  "netlists": [
    {
      "name": "main",
      "text": "RLC band-pass filter, R = 10, L = 10m, C = 1u, f0 = 1.592 kHz, Q = 10\n* A 1 V AC source drives a series L-C-R loop; the output is taken across R.\n* H(f) = V(out)/V(in) = R / (R + jwL + 1/(jwC)): 0 dB and 0 deg at f0 = 1/(2 pi sqrt(LC)),\n* -3 dB and +/-45 deg at fL = 1513.96 Hz and fH = 1673.12 Hz, so BW = f0/Q = 159.15 Hz.\n* Far from f0 the skirts rise and fall 20 dB/decade.\n* Read the bandwidth with two cursors on V(out)/V(in) in the Bode pane.\nV1 in 0 AC 1\nL1 in a 10m\nC1 a out 1u\nR1 out 0 10\n.ac dec 2000 10 100k\n.end\n"
    }
